  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n\nKANJI DISTINCTION:\n{搾|しぼ}る vs. {絞|しぼ}る — both read しぼる but use different kanji:\n- {搾|しぼ}る: to squeeze out, extract by pressing (juice, oil, milk)\n- {絞|しぼ}る: to wring (a towel), to narrow down (choices), to strangle\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {果汁|かじゅう}を{搾|しぼ}る: to squeeze juice\n- {乳|ちち}を{搾|しぼ}る: to milk\n- {油|あぶら}を{搾|しぼ}る: to press oil\n- {搾|しぼ}りたて: freshly squeezed/milked\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{搾|しぼ}っている describes the ongoing action of squeezing or milking.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {搾取|さくしゅ}: exploitation (figuratively \"squeezing\" people)",
